  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 6802.04 Reporting of Findings",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 6802.04 Reporting of Findings.\n\n(a) A written report shall be made and submitted to the commissioner upon completion of the evaluation.\n\n(b) The report shall include an evaluation of all categories listed in Saf-C 6802.02 including data collected from each device.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 6800) #9685, eff 3-23-10; ss by #12518, eff 4-23-18",
